    "detailed_description": "KIWAYA is a unique action weapon testing-game.<br>Start on ground level and go underground.<br>Your goal is to reach the target within the given time.<br>Every day you receive a new weapon and a new mission.<br>Destroy rocks &amp; bugs, get as deep as possible and receive advice from a penguin.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224010/extras/8ed2eccc994afc90e43ac8d12dcf5b39.poster.avif?t=1713441425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224010/extras/8ed2eccc994afc90e43ac8d12dcf5b39.webm?t=1713441425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224010/extras/8ed2eccc994afc90e43ac8d12dcf5b39.mp4?t=1713441425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- Create your own underground path.<br>- Several different weapons.<br>- 3 game modes.<br>- Game controller support.<br>- Achievements.<br>- There are no ads or in-app purchases.<br>- No data collected on gameplay/behaviour tracking.<br><br><strong>Play time</strong><br>Story Mode: 30-40 minutes.<br>Journey Mode: no time limit.<br>Orb Mode: challenging arcade mode (1-10 minutes)<br><br><strong>Accessibility info</strong><br>- All dialogue is written in game.<br>- Text size is big<br>- Use keyboard &amp; mouse or gamepad.<br>- Buttons can be remapped.",
